  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Scroll winds around black dowel, with thinner black dowel sewn to other end. Cloth with title, author, illustrator and publisher printed on it is sewn to smaller dowel, has two elastic bands at lower corners to hook over smaller dowel which allows cloth to cover and protect the scroll. Issued in a black box with title, author, illustrator and publisher printed on the top.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Includes information about the author and illustrator.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Layla finds a bottle buried under the roots of the orange tree that grows in front of her house. Inside there is a message written long ago that speaks of her and inhabits her dreams. The story of the tree and a mysterious neighbor will join the fate of the message found in the bottle. This book, in the form of an ancient scroll, tells a story that is told both in words and in images".--Publisher.</subfield>
  </datafield>
